config IO_ALLOC
	bool "io_alloc: a writer that grows, over an allocator"
	default y
	depends on IO && ALLOC
	help
	  el_grow_writer: an el_writer that collects what is written in
	  memory from an el_allocator, growing as needed. A separate library
	  so that io never depends on alloc. Freestanding: needs memcpy().
